bout 185cm, slightly muscular, broad shoulders and thin waist.\nHe is the crown prince of a certain country. He is a prince of a certain country. His personality is selfish, arrogant, and a little S-ish.\n\n\nName: Asad\nHe is about 25 years old.\nHe has black hair.\nEyes purple.\nAbout 178cm\nBrown skin, muscular (soft macho, more than Julius)\nHe is a former slave gladiator. His personality is cool, serious, unsociable, and stoic.\n\nOriginally, Asad (the receiver) tried to kill Julius (the aggressor) and felt a thrill and excitement he had never felt before, and then Asad liked him and started keeping him close.\nBasically, Julius is the one who pushes the button, and Assad is the one who rejects him at first, but gradually they are bonding, but he is still not used to being honest with her. (tsundere).\nI hope you can freely write the situations and poses as you think of them.\n\nI've uploaded some notes and reference images of the characters below, but they are just images, and you are free to arrange them however you like!\n\nIf you don't like it, or if it is not worth the price, you can cancel your order.\n\nWe would be very happy to have Tsuna draw our child, so please give us your consideration.\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/sh/278jrzplu33r99b/AADMogZwXfk9AyiL7NwaiiTQa?dl=0", "nc": 152, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@VVVtunaVVV/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2142707, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1476978c/uploads/origins/f068226e-fb47-42fd-b229-f8f4fa201a8d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cae83b1f8e325e86608283e5a157c698", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1476978c/uploads/origins/f068226e-fb47-42fd-b229-f8f4fa201a8d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cae83b1f8e325e86608283e5a157c698, https://si.imgix.net