ionship (one-way aggressive).\n\nBoth images are based on picrew's \"Harinezuban Danshi Maker (2)\" (https://picrew.me/image_maker/1453974).\n\n◻️Situation\nSorry for the out of the box request, but we would like you to draw a scene of the above two in their daily life.\nThere are no detailed specifications, except that we would like them to be close to each other physically.\nWe would be happy if they are close to each other.\n\n◻Purpose of use → for personal viewing and appreciation\n\nWe wish you the best of luck in your future endeavors.\nWe understand that you are busy, but we would appreciate your consideration.", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@VVVtunaVVV/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2142707, "client_id": 2119706, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2132d251/uploads/origins/bbfa817d-f2fe-4cfd-8ff7-7270bdc023be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=201ae5e2b55b67b70cf34c3d7a407143", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2132d251/uploads/origins/bbfa817d-f2fe-4cfd-8ff7-7270bdc023be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=201ae5e2b55b67b70cf34c3d7a407143, https://si.imgix.net/2132d251/uploads/origins/bbfa817d-f2fe-4cfd-8ff7-7270bdc023be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d9d6dc6b9f6214fd4b3982b946d15800 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2132d251/uploads/origins/bbfa817d-f2fe-4cfd-8ff7-7270bdc023be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7ba26ef18797bbc0ab9ac017475b1ae4 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2132d251/uploads/origins/bbfa817d-f2fe-4cfd-8ff7-7270bdc023be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2c1ae69b6e0ef08d